$DIR/test.p:90:9: invalid operation: x == y (union with variant A of type []int cannot be compared)
    The operator is not defined for this type. For example, + works on numbers
    and constant strings, < works on numbers and strings, and ! works only on
    bools. Structs, slices and funcs have no arithmetic.
    (see "Operators" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.18)
